DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260926T173000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260926T193000
SUMMARY:Laver Cup - Session Four
LOCATION:The O2
DESCRIPTION:Experience Tennis Unrivaled when the ninth edition of the Laver
 
 Cup returns to The O2 in London from September 25-27\, 2026. Born out of R
 
oger Federer's idea to create an event to honor Australian tennis legend Ro
 
d Laver\, the Laver Cup pits six of the best men's tennis players from Euro
 
pe against six of their counterparts from the rest of the world over three 
 
days of intense team competition. The teams are led by legendary captains\,
 
 Yannick Noah for Team Europe and Andre Agassi for Team World. Players conf
 
irmed to date: Team Europe: Carlos Alcaraz Alexander Zverev Flavio Cobolli 
 
Jakum Mensik Team World: Ben Shelton Alex de Minaur Taylor Fritz Alexander 
 
Bublik Additional players per team still to be announced. Played on a drama
 
tic black court\, the Laver Cup has superstar players as you have never see
 
n them before...where rivals become teammates\, competing in singles\, team
 
ing up in first-time doubles combinations\, and cheering each other on from
 
 the sidelines. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.co.uk/laver-cup-se
 
ssion-four-london-26-09-2026/event/350064D89B2DD23D
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.co.uk/laver-cup-session-four-london-26-09-2026
 
/event/350064D89B2DD23D
END:VEVENT
